#, kde-format
msgid "Curve free mode"
msgstr "حالت منحنی آزاد"

#: core/libs/dimg/filters/curves/curvesbox.cpp:128
#, kde-format
msgid "With this button, you can draw your curve free-hand with the mouse."
msgstr "با این دکمه می‌توانید منحنی خود را به‌صورت دستی با موشواره رسم کنید."

#: core/libs/dimg/filters/curves/curvesbox.cpp:134
#, kde-format
msgid "Curve smooth mode"
msgstr "حالت منحنی هموار"

#: core/libs/dimg/filters/curves/curvesbox.cpp:135
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"With this button, the curve type is constrained to be a smooth line with "
"tension."
msgstr "با این دکمه، نوع منحنی به یک خط هموار با کشش محدود می‌شود."

#: core/libs/dimg/filters/curves/curvesbox.cpp:160
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"With this button, you can pick the color from original image used to set "
"<b>Shadow Tone</b> smooth curves point on Red, Green, Blue, and Luminosity "
